# Environment variables file
.env

# Databases, anywhere in the tree. Canonical lives outside this repo and is
# shipped to the server as an immutable artifact; this service only ever reads
# one, and none should ever be committed here again. The trailing * also covers
# the -wal/-shm/-journal sidecars.
*.db*

# Go build outputs
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Output of go build
api_server
migrate_tool
bitcal-api
api_and_database

# OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Log files
logs/

# Migration script (local utility)
migrate.go


